WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.340
Split the Lark and
you'll find the Music

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:12.100
Bulb after Bulb, in Silver rolled

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.800
Scantily dealt to the Summer Morning

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.130
Saved for your ear when Lutes be old.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:30.790
Loose the Flood you
shall find it patent

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:57.960
Gush after Gush, reserved for you

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:01.130
[MUSIC]

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:14.590
Scarlet Experiment!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:25.960
Sceptic Thomas!

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:29.420
Now, do you doubt that
your Bird was true?

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:56.267
[MUSIC]

